#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:2
msgid "Declarative UI Guide"
msgstr "声明式开发指南"

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"The **declarative track** (``fluxent.decl``) builds native Windows "
"applications around ``flux_run`` and the element builders in "
"``<xtk/xtk.h>``. Your code keeps application state in a C ``struct``, "
"processes integer-tagged messages in ``update()``, and describes the "
"current interface in ``view()`` while the reconciler updates retained "
"controls incrementally."
msgstr ""
"**声明式路线** （ ``fluxent.decl`` ）围绕 ``flux_run`` 与 ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` 中的元素构建器开发原生 "
"Windows 应用。代码将应用状态存放在普通 C ``struct`` 中，在 ``update()`` 中处理带整数标签的消息，"
"在 ``view()`` 中描述当前界面结构，并由协调器对底层保留式控件执行增量更新。"

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Read the chapters in order when starting from scratch, or jump directly "
"to the control family your screen needs:"
msgstr "从零上手建议按章节顺序阅读，也可按页面需求直接查阅对应控件分类："

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:13
msgid ""
":doc:`mvu` — Master the Elm Model–View–Update cycle, dissect the "
"``fluxent.decl`` template, organize large message tables, register "
"control modules, and manage per-frame scratch strings."
msgstr ""
":doc:`mvu` —— 理解 Elm Model–View–Update 循环，逐行拆解 ``fluxent.decl`` 模板，组织大型消息分发表、"
"注册控件模块并管理帧内存池动态字符串。"

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`layout` — Arrange interfaces with Flex stacks, cards, modifiers, "
"controlled ``ScrollViewer`` viewports, inherited typography, and async "
"WIC images."
msgstr ""
":doc:`layout` —— 使用 Flex 堆栈容器、卡片、布局修饰器、受控 ``ScrollViewer`` 视口、"
"可继承文本样式与异步 WIC 图像编排界面。"

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:19
msgid ""
":doc:`inputs` — Handle buttons, toggles, sliders, localized "
"``NumberBox``, controlled ``TextBox`` / ``AutoSuggestBox`` edits, and "
"date, time, calendar, and color pickers."
msgstr ""
":doc:`inputs` —— 处理按钮、开关、滑块、本地化 ``NumberBox`` 、受控 ``TextBox`` / ``AutoSuggestBox`` "
"文本编辑，以及日期、时间、日历与颜色选择器。"

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`collections` — Render 100,000-row virtualized ``ListView`` and "
"``GridView`` collections, sticky group headers, sortable column headers, "
"``TreeView`` hierarchies, keys, and memoized subtrees."
msgstr ""
":doc:`collections` —— 渲染 10 万行级虚拟化 ``ListView`` 与 ``GridView`` 、吸顶分组标题、"
"可排序拖拽列头、层级 ``TreeView`` 、节点键（Key）与缓存区域。"

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:25
msgid ""
":doc:`navigation` — Structure multi-page shells with ``NavigationView``, "
"``TabView``, ``SplitView``, custom ``TitleBar``, ``CommandBar`` overflow "
"menus, modal ``ContentDialog``, ``TeachingTip``, and status bars."
msgstr ""
":doc:`navigation` —— 使用 ``NavigationView`` 、 ``TabView`` 、 ``SplitView`` 、自定义 ``TitleBar`` 、"
" ``CommandBar`` 溢出工具栏、模态 ``ContentDialog`` 、 ``TeachingTip`` 与状态栏搭建多页应用外壳。"

#: ../../source/declarative/index.rst:28
msgid ""
":doc:`host` — Access ``FluxApp *`` for native file dialogs, OLE drag-and-"
"drop, clipboard data, live theme/backdrop switching, and background "
"worker threads."
msgstr ""
":doc:`host` —— 获取 ``FluxApp *`` 调用原生文件对话框、OLE 拖放、剪贴板读写、"
"实时主题与背景材质切换以及后台工作线程通信。"
